Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.88,0:00:04.32,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix],Today I'll PriPara, tomorrow I'll PriPara,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.32,0:00:09.02,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,and thinking about it, yesterday I PriPara'd...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.02,0:00:09.78,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.41,0:00:14.88,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[honorific][term fix],Oh, Ms. Meganee.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.88,0:00:16.29,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,This is a special report.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.29,0:00:19.37,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,As of today, PriPara has been outlawed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.37,0:00:20.33,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.27,0:00:22.79,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,It's a real shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.79,0:00:24.75,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.42,0:00:28.22,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,N-No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.55,0:00:35.90,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Ow ow ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.51,0:00:41.79,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Oh, PriPara being banned was just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.79,0:00:43.33,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:45.53,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Oh, what's up, Non?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.18,0:00:47.35,Default,Non,0,0,0,,You weren't dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.35,0:00:49.54,Default,Non,0,0,0,[honorific],It really happened, Laala{Onee-chan}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.54,0:00:50.94,Default,Non,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.94,0:00:52.52,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,I repeat,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.52,0:00:55.62,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,PriPara has been outlawed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.62,0:00:57.25,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,PriPara is ding dong dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:01:00.13,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You mean it wasn't just a bad dream?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.13,0:01:01.43,Default,Non,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:04.96,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,It wasn't a dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.15,0:02:38.87,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,PriPara Has Been Outlawed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.17,0:02:44.03,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,PriPara being outlawed...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.81,0:02:46.69,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I don't want that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.69,0:02:49.04,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,But that doesn't matter! I need to get to PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.34,0:02:53.83,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix],Headmistress!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.83,0:02:56.50,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,This is horrible! PriPara has...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.67,0:02:58.53,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.07,0:03:06.29,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],That Reona! Why didn't he wake me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.99,0:03:09.02,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,How rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.63,0:03:16.00,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],Oops! Sorry, Dorothy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.00,0:03:17.49,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],Laala, watch where you're--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.49,0:03:18.98,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],You better run too, Dorothy{-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.98,0:03:19.36,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Whuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.36,0:03:21.51,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,I can smell PriTickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.51,0:03:22.11,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.91,0:03:24.22,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,I smell them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.22,0:03:26.40,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Now that PriPara has been banned,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.40,0:03:28.07,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,it's time to confiscate them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.51,0:03:29.84,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],Headmistress Ookanda?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.98,0:03:31.52,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.52,0:03:34.80,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Hand over your PriTickets!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.80,0:03:36.33,Default,Rina,0,0,0,,PriTicket!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.68,0:03:39.26,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],What's the headmistress's deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.26,0:03:41.19,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,It's like she's back to her old self.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.19,0:03:43.20,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,She started chasing me all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:45.93,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,All because PriPara has been outlawed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.93,0:03:46.80,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.12,0:03:48.10,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Outlawed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.10,0:03:49.37,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.37,0:03:50.41,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.41,0:03:52.82,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Non said it was true, and it was on PriPara News...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.82,0:03:55.23,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,For Pete's sake, this is why you're still a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.11,0:03:58.44,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Look at this peaceful sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.99,0:04:00.90,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Parajuku is the same as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.90,0:04:03.03,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Let's forget about this crazy talk and head on over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.03,0:04:04.36,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],But Dorothy{-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.49,0:04:06.57,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.88,0:04:09.34,Default,Eiko,0,0,0,,We're the PriTicket Confiscation Squad!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.34,0:04:11.28,Default,Eiko,0,0,0,,We'll be confiscating your PriTickets!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.28,0:04:13.74,Default-Alt,Eiko,0,0,0,,Now hand it over!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.52,0:04:13.74,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\3c&H0C0C87&}This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.74,0:04:16.08,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,[honorific],Hand them over-chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.08,0:04:18.33,Default,Rands,0,0,0,,PriTickets!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.70,0:04:23.40,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Ninja art of camouflage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.08,0:04:25.54,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Is this real?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.54,0:04:27.76,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,It's just like something I'd see in a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.73,0:04:30.72,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,This isn't a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.74,0:04:34.05,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],I hope Reona's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.05,0:04:36.18,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],I'm sure Sion will look after him, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.67,0:04:39.63,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],You sure are caring, Dorothy{-san}.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.00,0:04:44.44,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,There's no one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.49,0:04:47.07,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[honorific][term fix],Even Ms. Meganee isn't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.07,0:04:48.81,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I wonder if we can still scan our PriTickets...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.28,0:04:52.59,Default,Larthy,0,0,0,,It worked!
Comment: 0,0:04:53.90,0:04:55.13,Default,Larthy,0,0,0,,Uh....
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.06,0:05:06.92,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,PriPara has been abandoned?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.92,0:05:08.40,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.27,0:05:13.41,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,No way. My beloved PriPara has...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.41,0:05:14.68,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I don't want this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.47,0:05:16.64,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.64,0:05:17.64,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I'm not crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.18,0:05:19.34,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,There's no way I'd cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.76,0:05:21.14,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.14,0:05:23.27,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix],If you say so, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.27,0:05:25.04,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],Don't imitate Reona!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.82,0:05:27.97,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix],Dorothy, relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.97,0:05:29.28,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Like I said, don't imitate Reona--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.28,0:05:31.74,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Say it to me too...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.74,0:05:34.86,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I-I see, you're the one who's scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.48,0:05:37.23,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],Laala, relax--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.91,0:05:45.67,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,PriPara has been outlawed-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.67,0:05:47.66,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,We're going to capture you-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.66,0:05:49.38,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Nekon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.26,0:05:55.09,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I feel like I've heard these monsters's\N voices somewhere before...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.09,0:05:57.17,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,It's just your imagination-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.17,0:05:59.41,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce. Just my imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.41,0:06:00.70,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],W-Where's Reona?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.70,0:06:01.35,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.73,0:06:06.99,Default,Neko,0,0,0,[term fix],Reona and the others have been captured and\Nimprisoned in the cage known as the TV station.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.99,0:06:10.67,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,But that's something you shouldn't know-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.20,0:06:12.95,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],R-Reona's been...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.25,0:06:17.14,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix],Dorothy, I'll distract the monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.14,0:06:19.06,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You go find{ahead to} the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.06,0:06:20.54,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Okay! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.54,0:06:21.81,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Hold on a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.81,0:06:23.61,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,This makes you look like the cool one!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.61,0:06:25.56,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We don't have time for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.56,0:06:28.04,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,The better looking one is a better decoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.18,0:06:30.01,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Now get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.48,0:06:31.34,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,But!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.34,0:06:32.07,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.07,0:06:33.33,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],You better find Reona!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.33,0:06:34.31,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],And Sion!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.31,0:06:34.97,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix],Dorothy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.97,0:06:36.18,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.94,0:06:40.02,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,There's no way I can go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.39,0:06:42.64,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.11,0:06:44.40,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.40,0:06:45.86,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Nekon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.86,0:06:53.92,Default,Larthy,0,0,0,,PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.92,0:06:54.63,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Ha?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.31,0:06:56.20,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.16,0:07:01.38,Default,Kukogi,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.83,0:07:04.33,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Operation: Heart pounding surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.33,0:07:05.12,Default,Nekogi,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.60,0:07:06.28,Default,Larthy,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.28,0:07:08.99,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Now, now, look over at the camera-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.99,0:07:11.24,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Yes, it was a huge success-nekon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.24,0:07:12.13,Default,Larthy,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.79,0:07:20.77,Default,Larthy,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.22,0:07:23.61,Default,Larthy,0,0,0,,What the?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.23,0:07:25.25,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],Laala{-chan}!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.25,0:07:26.66,Default,Rand2,0,0,0,[term fix],Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.66,0:07:27.98,Default,Rand3,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.98,0:07:29.89,Default,Rand4,0,0,0,[term fix],Laala, I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.42,0:07:31.85,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What's this all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.30,0:07:34.91,Default,Miphie,0,0,0,,1, 2...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.91,0:07:35.82,Default,Miphie,0,0,0,[term fix],Laala,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.40,0:07:39.63,Default,Miphie,0,0,0,,congratulations on your one year debut anniversary!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.33,0:07:43.82,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,One year?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.82,0:07:45.00,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.00,0:07:47.80,Default,Nao,0,0,0,[term fix],It's been a year since you made your debut, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:49.45,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,This is a commemoration party. {I don't believe a 10-11 year old would say it this way but we ball}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.45,0:07:52.14,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What about PriPara being outlawed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.14,0:07:53.14,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.14,0:07:55.55,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,That was to make it a bigger surprise-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.55,0:07:56.18,Default,Larthy,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.18,0:08:00.89,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],Meganee, Non{-chan}, and everyone else all worked together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.89,0:08:01.93,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.93,0:08:02.85,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.28,0:08:08.81,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,The abandoned PriPara ye saw earlier\N was generated with hologrammation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.61,0:08:12.12,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You went overboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.12,0:08:13.11,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.88,0:08:16.35,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,We were touched when you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.35,0:08:21.58,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,rushed towards PriPara despite the obstacles in your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.58,0:08:22.97,Default,Kukogi,0,0,0,,Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.97,0:08:25.26,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,You guys went the most overboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.26,0:08:26.79,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.26,0:08:26.79,Default-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,{\3c&H9B1614&}Usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.59,0:08:29.88,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],But I'm glad you're safe, Reona.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.88,0:08:33.45,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],You should have told me you were going to surprise Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.45,0:08:35.25,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,But I did tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.25,0:08:37.41,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,You were just too busy reading your manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.41,0:08:38.18,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.18,0:08:41.34,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,It's your fault since you didn't listen-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.34,0:08:42.26,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Shut your trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.69,0:08:46.24,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,I even tried waking you up this morning,\N thinking that if I left you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.24,0:08:49.55,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,somehow you'd get mixed up in the surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.14,0:08:54.22,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix],I'm glad it was all just a prank, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.22,0:08:56.54,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Thanks for being a decoy with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.75,0:09:00.56,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],It's not like I did it for you, Laala.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.56,0:09:02.29,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,There's no need to thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.59,0:09:07.65,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,[honorific],I'd like to thank Amamiya{-kun} \Nfor recording your trip to PriPara...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.88,0:09:13.01,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,and Tokuda Nene from the Newspaper Club \Nfor recording everything once you got inside-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.01,0:09:14.57,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,All in a day's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.03,0:09:24.69,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],Now I'd like to invite our guest of honor, Laala{-san},\N up to say a few words and capisce-chanko.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.69,0:09:26.93,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],Laala{-san}, if you would-chanko.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.26,0:09:28.68,Default,Nao,0,0,0,[term fix],You're up, Laala.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.68,0:09:30.41,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.41,0:09:31.59,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.62,0:09:37.32,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.32,0:09:41.01,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,E-Everyone who's here for m-me t-today...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.01,0:09:42.38,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Too stiff! Way too stiff!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.38,0:09:43.73,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.73,0:09:45.37,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.54,0:09:56.00,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Everyone, you all made me very capisce today!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.34,0:09:58.46,Default,Everyone,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.92,0:10:01.37,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Thanks, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.53,0:10:03.66,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,[term fix],Laala.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.39,0:10:07.60,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,[term fix],So it's your one year debut anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.60,0:10:08.60,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Congrats.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.60,0:10:10.71,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Thank you, Fuwari.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.71,0:10:12.06,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,This made me so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.57,0:10:15.05,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Time flies when you're having fun-tori.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.05,0:10:18.88,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Toriko will be a grandma pretty soon-tori.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.88,0:10:22.03,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Toriko will be all alone in her old age-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.03,0:10:24.40,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,A truly glorious Sabbat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.40,0:10:27.30,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Since you're aiming for the Summer Dream Idol GranPrix,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.30,0:10:30.12,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,shouldn't you be working to recruit Fuwari-nekon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.12,0:10:34.61,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Naturally, I have not the slightest intention of\Nremaining concealed underground like a mole.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.61,0:10:37.13,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Of course. So you have a plan-nekon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.13,0:10:41.34,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Now onto some words of congratulation from our guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.34,0:10:44.90,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,[honorific][term fix],First up we have Meganee. Please take it away{-chan}ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.90,0:10:49.64,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],Laala{-san}, congratulations on your one year PriPara debut anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.64,0:10:52.46,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I don't really have any gifts for the occasion...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.46,0:10:54.24,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Of course you don't-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.24,0:10:58.52,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,I'm here to congratulate you on behalf of us secretaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.52,0:11:00.77,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,That is all. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.32,0:11:03.28,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Next up...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.63,0:11:04.49,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Mom?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.39,0:11:08.45,Default,Mama,0,0,0,[term fix],Laala, congrats on your one year debut anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.04,0:11:11.82,Default,Mama,0,0,0,,To think you've become this beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.82,0:11:16.13,Default,Mama,0,0,0,,Thank you for being born as our child.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.85,0:11:23.20,Default,Mama,0,0,0,,I hope you find PriPara to be as \Nprecious as your mother found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.77,0:11:26.93,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Aw. You're saying too much, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.79,0:11:30.77,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,[honorific],When my darling Rina{-chan} was born,\N she had a weak constitution,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.77,0:11:37.10,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,but by focusing on raising her seriously,\N she was able to become so healthy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.10,0:11:42.29,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,[honorific],Rina{-chan}, thank you for being manufactured\Nto be my vacuum cleaner!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.29,0:11:43.89,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,I love you lots!
Comment: 0,0:11:46.03,0:11:49.03,Default,Mama,0,0,0,,Oh my PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.03,0:11:49.03,Default-Alt,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Oh my PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.40,0:11:51.61,Default,Rands,0,0,0,,Congrats...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.81,0:11:57.82,Default,Nao,0,0,0,[term fix],My childhood friend, Laala, has always been very shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.82,0:12:04.81,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,But now she has so many fans cheering her on as an idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.81,0:12:06.63,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Keep on fighting the good fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.67,0:12:10.68,Default,Eiko,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],Laala{-chan}, congrats on your one year debut anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.68,0:12:15.38,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[honorific],Eiko{-chan}, thank you for being my fan for a whole year.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.38,0:12:17.81,Default,Rabu,0,0,0,,In tennis, you would be a service ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.81,0:12:21.11,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,[honorific],Next up is the pink actress, Nanami{-chan}-chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.85,0:12:23.64,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,I'm Nanami!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.64,0:12:24.53,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,Kyupiko--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.82,0:12:35.66,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,Kyupikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.66,0:12:38.66,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,[honorific],Nanami{-chan}, thank you-chanko.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.66,0:12:40.29,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Now then, up next...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.57,0:12:41.63,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.63,0:12:42.11,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.11,0:12:42.71,Default,Rand2,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.71,0:12:43.39,Default,Rand3,0,0,0,,What's happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.39,0:12:44.09,Default,Rand4,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.54,0:12:46.14,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Just what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.14,0:12:47.14,Default,Shion,0,0,0,[term fix],Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.66,0:12:55.43,Default,Shion,0,0,0,[term fix],Let's celebrate your one year debut anniversary!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.43,0:12:57.73,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,You've always worked so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.73,0:12:58.92,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.92,0:13:02.73,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,[term fix],We have a celebratory concert from her rivals, Dressing Pafé!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.73,0:13:04.69,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Wow! I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.01,0:13:08.57,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I'll never forget how you were there for me today!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.03,0:13:10.53,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I won't forget either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.46,0:13:14.34,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Let's Go steal the spotlight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.34,0:13:17.83,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,[term fix],Dressing Pafé's "Change! My World"!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.53,0:13:56.87,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.88,0:14:02.71,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Drums!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.47,0:14:08.59,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Guitar!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.37,0:14:13.71,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Bass!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.45,0:14:17.68,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Stereo at Full Blast! 2:3 Rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.15,0:14:20.93,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,[term fix],And Laala, congrats!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.09,0:14:24.93,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.35,0:14:31.53,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.37,0:14:44.94,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,You knocked it out of the park!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.37,0:14:44.31,Default-Alt,Rand,0,0,0,[term fix],Sion rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.16,0:14:44.94,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,{\3c&HC44742&}Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.94,0:14:45.66,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.66,0:14:46.84,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Nekon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.15,0:14:50.74,Default,Cosmos,0,0,0,,Since we're celebrating today,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.74,0:14:56.13,Default,Cosmos,0,0,0,[term fix],I've designed a new Cyalume Coord for SoLaMi SMILE and Dressing Pafé.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.13,0:14:58.76,Default,Cosmos,0,0,0,,I think you'll look cosmically good in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.20,0:15:02.08,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Flawless and broad minded!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.08,0:15:04.48,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],Have you gotten nice and warmed up, Laala?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.48,0:15:07.47,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'll just keep on saying it, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.47,0:15:08.94,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.48,0:15:15.70,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[term fix],I was happy to know how much you love PriPara when you almost cried, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.70,0:15:16.97,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Almost cried?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.67,0:15:19.14,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.14,0:15:20.76,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I didn't cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.76,0:15:29.26,Default,Non,0,0,0,[honorific],Lady Fuwari, the princess scholarship student,\Nhas a brightly shining aura and overflows with vitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.81,0:15:32.10,Default,Non,0,0,0,[honorific],Please get her autograph for me, Laala!{Onee-chan}!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.10,0:15:33.63,Default-Alt,Rand,0,0,0,,Cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.63,0:15:35.61,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[honorific],"Lady Fuwari"...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.66,0:15:38.46,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,And we end with...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.18,0:15:41.27,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Falulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.27,0:15:43.68,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,[term fix],How have you been, Laala?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.68,0:15:45.66,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Energetic and lively!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.66,0:15:48.26,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Compared to your Parajuku PriPara,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.26,0:15:51.49,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,I have PriParis PriPara.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.49,0:15:53.25,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,While we may be far apart,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.25,0:15:54.49,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,we'll always be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.12,0:15:56.64,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Falulu...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.64,0:15:57.70,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.19,0:16:01.47,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,I also have one more surprise for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.13,0:16:05.00,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,I am supposed to get a summer vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.00,0:16:08.37,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,When I do, I'm going to come visit you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.37,0:16:09.60,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,See you soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.60,0:16:10.86,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.11,0:16:14.42,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,That was a great surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.68,0:16:19.33,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Everyone, thank you so much for everything today!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.33,0:16:21.07,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.07,0:16:22.72,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,100)}Concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.72,0:16:24.37,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,100)}Concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.37,0:16:26.02,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,100)}Concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.02,0:16:27.81,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,0)}Concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.99,0:16:32.86,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.69,0:16:36.11,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.03,0:16:40.09,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.59,0:16:47.46,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,[term fix],This romantic coord really suits your one year PriPara debut anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.46,0:16:52.94,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,The different colours really bring out all three of your personalities!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.94,0:16:55.30,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Which one do I like, you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.30,0:16:57.99,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,I can't decide. They're all too cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.99,0:17:00.14,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Dream Heart Race Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.94,0:17:01.80,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.31,0:17:53.65,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.41,0:17:58.69,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Suddenly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.31,0:18:00.70,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.83,0:18:09.54,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Present for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.41,0:18:13.50,Default,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.27,0:18:22.90,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is a wonderful coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.90,0:18:25.30,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[honorific],{\i1}Thank you, Cosmos{-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.17,0:18:32.73,Default,All,0,0,0,[term fix],Laala, congratulations on your one year debut anniversary!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.65,0:18:36.35,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.57,0:18:46.07,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,A pop and a step and I've gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.63,0:18:48.41,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I love you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.92,0:18:52.29,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Please continue to support me and capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.29,0:18:55.40,Default,All,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.64,0:19:00.21,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.59,0:19:04.52,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,[term fix],SoLaMi SMILE's Friend Ticket snapping event is over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.52,0:19:07.25,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,[honorific],Please line up here-chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.25,0:19:08.22,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Welcome-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.22,0:19:09.68,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Welkuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.04,0:19:15.21,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,[term fix],Laala's one year debut anniversary emblem, designed by Houjou Cosmo, is now on sale-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.21,0:19:17.02,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Make sure you buy one!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.02,0:19:18.52,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,And on top of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.52,0:19:21.89,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,we also have tons of other commemorative goods such as, Capisce pillows, Capisce buns, Capisce macaroons, Capisce cups,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.89,0:19:25.62,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Capisce marionettes, Capisce mufflers, Capisce margaritas, Capisce merlions, Capisce frames, Capisce margarine,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.62,0:19:28.86,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Capisce Paris daisies, Capisce grapes, Capisce cloaks, rice balls, bread, sandwiches, juices, teas, towels, handkerchiefs,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.86,0:19:31.21,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,socks, fans, kendamas, and furikake-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.21,0:19:32.16,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.57,0:19:36.29,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,We've also made 200,000 stuffed animals of me-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.29,0:19:41.86,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,We're selling them so I can have the hibernation of my dreams in a 17LDKS cave with a smile on my face-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.86,0:19:43.32,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Like a celeb!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.62,0:19:52.56,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,PriPara and concerts are lots of fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.14,0:20:00.98,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.55,0:20:08.86,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.43,0:20:12.37,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,[honorific],It's from my prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.13,0:20:15.28,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,You've done your best not to eat it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.80,0:20:31.10,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}An elegant princess will usher in a new dawn on the world of idols just like the rising sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.63,0:20:32.61,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.59,0:20:39.19,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}To help you, I've given you a perfect Making Drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.19,0:20:46.82,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}You are a princess born from nature, just like a nightingale who can sing by instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.82,0:20:49.37,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now be dyed in my colour.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.33,0:20:56.91,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,[honorific],For me, Prince{-sama}...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.47,0:20:59.23,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.62,0:21:04.76,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,[term fix],The newly written page titled Summer Dream Grand Prix in my Aroma Prophecy Grimoire...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.76,0:21:08.09,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,...shall be decided by the wings of the demon, angel, and Fuwari.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.49,0:21:13.05,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Come, let us celebrate Pripargisnacht together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.53,0:21:25.69,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,There are still this many stuffed animals of me left-kuma...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.69,0:21:28.12,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,As I thought, 200,000 was too many-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.12,0:21:30.92,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I should have only had 199,800 made-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.92,0:21:32.67,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,This is horrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.14,0:21:34.91,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I'm so in debt-kuma.
